#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:1
msgid "The Public Path Table"
msgstr "公网路径表"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:3
msgid ""
"HybridInference ships two long-running HTTP services: the FastAPI gateway"
" (`apps/backend`) and a Next.js console (`apps/frontend`). Only one of "
"them needs to be reachable from the internet."
msgstr ""
"HybridInference 会跑两个长期运行的 HTTP 服务：FastAPI 网关（`apps/backend`）和 Next.js "
"控制台（`apps/frontend`）。其中只有一个需要能从公网访问到。"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:7
msgid ""
"**The console owns the public path table.** It is the process that "
"terminates public traffic. Static gateway forwarding lives in the "
"`rewrites()` configuration in `apps/frontend/next.config.js`; proxies "
"whose destinations must remain changeable after the image is built live "
"in App Router route handlers. Anything not named by either mechanism is "
"served by the console's own pages."
msgstr ""
"**公开路径表由控制台掌管。** 它是终结公网流量的进程。静态网关转发写在 `apps/frontend/next.config.js` 的 "
"`rewrites()` 配置中；目标地址需要在镜像构建后仍可修改的代理，则写成 App Router route "
"handler。两种机制都没有点名的路径，由控制台自己的页面提供。"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:14
msgid ""
"This is worth stating plainly because it is easy to get wrong from the "
"outside: adding a public route is an edit to `next.config.js` or a route "
"handler, not to whatever reverse proxy or tunnel happens to sit in front."
" A path missing from both is answered by the console's HTML 404 page — "
"which reads to an API client as \"the gateway is down\" rather than "
"\"this path is not forwarded\"."
msgstr ""
"这一点值得明说，因为从外面看很容易搞错：新增公开路由要改 `next.config.js` 或 route "
"handler，而不是改前面碰巧挡着的反向代理或隧道。两边都没有的路径会由控制台的 HTML 404 页面响应——在 API "
"客户端看来，这更像「网关挂了」，而不是「这个路径没有被转发」。"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:30
msgid "The path table"
msgstr "路径表"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:32
msgid ""
"The table below combines the static rewrites with the filesystem route "
"handlers. `apps/frontend/next.config.js` is the source of truth for "
"rewrites; the matching `route.ts` file is the source of truth for a "
"runtime handler."
msgstr ""
"下表同时列出静态 rewrites 和文件系统 route handlers。`apps/frontend/next.config.js` 是 "
"rewrites 的事实来源；对应的 `route.ts` 文件是运行时 handler 的事实来源。"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:36
msgid ""
"Destination resolution is deliberately split. Next resolves `rewrites()` "
"at **build** time and writes them into `.next/routes-manifest.json`. "
"Route handlers read their server-only environment at request time, so "
"changing those targets requires recreating the container, not rebuilding "
"the image."
msgstr ""
"目标地址的解析时机被有意拆开。Next 在**构建**时解析 `rewrites()` 并把它们写入 `.next/routes-"
"manifest.json`。Route handlers "
"在请求到来时读取仅服务端可见的环境变量，因此修改这些目标只需重新创建容器，无需重建镜像。"

