#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:65
msgid ""
"The handler streams request and response bodies, including SSE, but it "
"cannot accept WebSocket upgrades. A future WebSocket endpoint needs an "
"upgrade-aware proxy in front of Next.js."
msgstr ""
"这个 handler 会流式转发请求体和响应体，包括 SSE，但不能接受 WebSocket 升级。将来的 WebSocket 端点需要在 "
"Next.js 前面配置支持协议升级的代理。"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:68
msgid ""
"Hop-by-hop headers are removed, cookies are preserved, and redirects that"
" name either internal agent service are folded back through its public "
"prefix."
msgstr "逐跳（hop-by-hop）头会被移除，cookie 会被保留；指向任一 agent 内部服务的重定向会折回到对应的公开前缀。"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:71
msgid "Legacy `beforeFiles` compatibility"
msgstr "旧版 `beforeFiles` 兼容桥"

#: ../developer/public-path-table.md:73
msgid ""
"`next.config.js` still emits the same three rules as `beforeFiles` "
"rewrites when both agent URLs are supplied **while building** an older "
"distribution image. This is only a transition bridge: canonical neutral "
"images supply neither build arg and use the runtime handler above. "
"Because `beforeFiles` wins over a filesystem route, an image built with "
"those legacy values keeps its baked-in targets and cannot be retargeted "
"by changing only the container environment."
msgstr ""
"当**构建**旧版分发镜像时同时提供两个 agent URL，`next.config.js` 仍会生成相同的三条 `beforeFiles` "
"rewrite 规则。这只是迁移期兼容桥：规范的中立镜像不会提供这两个构建参数，而是使用上面的运行时 handler。由于 "
"`beforeFiles` 的优先级高于文件系统路由，使用旧值构建的镜像会保留烤入其中的目标地址，无法只靠修改容器环境来重新指向。"

